9,"Nilo-Saharan Language Family: Classification, Distribution, and...",https://soluap.com/nilo-saharan-language-family-classification-distribution-and-shared-linguistic-features/,"The Nilo-Saharan language family represents one of Africa’s most diverse and widely dispersed linguistic phyla.2. Geographical Distribution. Nilo-Saharan languages are spoken across a wide belt of Africa, including: North Africa: Egypt, Sudan, Chad.",Shatt,Nilo-Saharan
